#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""A clean-room reimplementation of the observed bat 0.26.1 CLI behavior.

This intentionally implements the user-visible behavior exercised by the
bundled documentation and by black-box observation: cat-compatible output in
non-interactive mode, common bat flags, help/listing outputs, simple
formatting/decorations, configuration helpers, and cache helper messages.
